    "explanation": "The full original recovery first-delivery scope is retained without reduction: paired Core2 base and recovery companion source inspection; genuine versioned RecoveryCheckpoint (moriarty-recovery-checkpoint/1) carrying pending, forward-complete, and recovery-complete states; real language start, normal resume, refund/compensate recovery, file publication, OS-process exit, fresh-process event-free reopen (including terminal reopen), and fresh-process public mori test execution; full preservation of prefix effects, fees, gross debits, C/T work counters, full invocation history, and positive/present-zero liabilities; all 35 MPLRs, all UNI clauses, all 148 requirements/292 scenarios/20 UTXO families, 69 U/M/MC/SP/G exits, and ACTUS 277 / DeFi 72 / 5 composition operators. Narrower substitutes (waiting JSON viewer, bare Continuation, in-memory-only Process, test-only writer, or host copy/sum emulation) are rejected. All 12 designated-owner rules (O-ID through O-IO) remain mandatory and open, and no example arithmetic, identity, work, or byte fixture is certified as an independent golden by this vote.",
